# astrion-skill v1
goal: Summarize text from the clipboard via the local AI
trigger:
  - phrase: "summarize"
  - phrase: "tldr"
  - phrase: "tl;dr"
do: |
  Read the clipboard. If empty, show "Nothing to summarize — copy text
  first." Otherwise route through aiService with a 3-bullet-summary
  prompt. Show the summary in a notification with a "Copy summary"
  button. Local Ollama only — no data leaves the machine.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 800
  reversibility: FREE
